xenomorph-wall-nest-unreachable = Move closer to an accessible wall.
xenomorph-wall-nest-no-resin = The wall must be covered in resin. Plant weeds next to it.
xenomorph-wall-nest-occupied = This wall already has a nest.
xenomorph-wall-nest-plasma = You need 100 plasma to build the nest.

xenomorph-armor-name = Armor
xenomorph-armor-desc = Your carapace reduces incoming damage. Click to see its current values.
xenomorph-armor-values = Overall: { $general } | Front: { $front } | Sides: { $side } | Explosions: { $explosion }

reagent-name-xenomorph-pain-toxin = xenomorph pain toxin
reagent-desc-xenomorph-pain-toxin = A toxin that causes intense pain and breaks down painkillers.

ent-ActionXenomorphSelfImmolate = Self-immolate
    .desc = Spend 50 plasma to coat yourself in fuel and ignite after 1.5 seconds. Moving interrupts ignition.
ent-ActionXenomorphThermoregulation = Thermoregulation
    .desc = While burning, spend 40 plasma to move 35% faster and attack 20% faster for 5 seconds. Extinguishes you when the effect ends.
xenomorph-thermoregulation-not-burning = You must be on fire to regulate your temperature.

ent-ActionXenomorphTailStab = Tail stab
    .desc = Strike the first enemy in front of your tail, up to 2.5 meters away. Cooldown is 10 seconds on a hit or 1 second on a miss. Costs no plasma.
ent-ActionXenomorphTailSlam = Tail slam
    .desc = Strike the first enemy in front of your tail, up to 2.5 meters away. Cooldown is 10 seconds on a hit or 1 second on a miss. Costs no plasma.

ent-ActionXenomorphCrusherCharge = Charge (20)
    .desc = After a 1.2-second windup, charge up to 5 meters. Deal 65 damage, stun and fling the target. Slows nearby enemies on impact. Cooldown: 42 seconds.
ent-ActionXenomorphCrusherSoak = Soak (20)
    .desc = Take 240 damage within 6 seconds to heal 120 health and reset your tail cooldown. Cooldown: 17 seconds.
ent-ActionXenomorphCrusherShield = Defensive shield (50)
    .desc = Absorb 100 damage for up to 7 seconds, reducing each positive damage type by 8 before absorption. Grants explosion resistance for 2.5 seconds and a 10% chance to reflect frontal projectiles. Cooldown: 26 seconds.

ent-ActionXenomorphVomitBile = Vomit bile (40)
    .desc = Extinguish a burning allied xeno or coat enemies with fuel across three rows ahead of you. Ignites enemies while you are burning. Also extinguishes fire on the selected tile. Cooldown: 8 seconds.
xenomorph-bile-no-target = There is no valid target for your bile.

ent-ActionXenomorphSlowingSpit = Slowing spit (20)
    .desc = Fire neurotoxin up to 5 meters. Slows for 8 seconds, paralyzes targets without physical armor for 3.5 seconds and removes 2 units of each medicine in their blood. Cooldown: 2 seconds.
ent-ActionXenomorphScatteredSpit = Scattered spit (30)
    .desc = Fire five projectiles in a 90-degree cone with a range of 4 meters. Paralyzes for 1 second, even through armor. Cooldown: 7 seconds.

ent-ActionXenomorphAcidSpit = Acid spit (25)
    .desc = Fire acid up to 7 meters, dealing 20 heat damage. Cooldown: 2.5 seconds.

ent-ActionXenomorphChargeSpit = Charge spit (50)
    .desc = Gain 40% movement speed and 5 armor for four seconds. Your next spit deals extra damage and coats its target in acid.
ent-ActionXenomorphSprayAcid = Spray acid (40)
    .desc = Spray acid in a line up to six meters long. Strengthens charged spit acid on its victims.
ent-ActionXenomorphCorrosiveTail = Corrosive tail
    .desc = Stab the first enemy ahead and inject two units of molecular acid.
xenomorph-remove-acid = Remove acid
reagent-name-xenomorph-molecular-acid = molecular acid
reagent-desc-xenomorph-molecular-acid = A corrosive toxin produced by xenomorphs.

ent-ActionXenomorphAcidBarrage = Acid barrage (75)
    .desc = Activate, then hold the attack button to charge for up to five seconds. Release to fire projectiles that leave acid pools. Catalyze adds five projectiles.
ent-ActionXenomorphCausticEmbrace = Caustic embrace (50)
    .desc = Leap up to three meters and splash acid upon landing. Catalyze instead lunges at an enemy up to five meters away and applies intense acid.
ent-ActionXenomorphOozingWounds = Oozing wounds (50)
    .desc = Release acid waves around yourself. Wounds increase the radius. Consumes hypertension; Catalyze strengthens the acid and paralyzes victims.
ent-ActionXenomorphCatalyze = Catalyze
    .desc = Spend a hypertension stack to empower your next ability for fifteen seconds. Attacks and incoming damage generate hypertension.
xenomorph-despoiler-no-hypertension = You need hypertension to catalyze an ability.


ent-ActionXenomorphCarrierParasite = Carrier's Bond
    .desc = Target nearby facehuggers to store up to 16. Retrieve one with an empty hand, or throw a held facehugger up to four meters. Activate it in your hand to store it again.
ent-ActionXenomorphCarrierEgg = Store and retrieve eggs
    .desc = Target nearby loose eggs to store them. Retrieve an egg with an empty hand. Activate a held egg to store it again.
ent-ActionXenomorphCarrierReserve = Set facehugger reserve
    .desc = Reserve stored facehuggers. Ghosts can join as children above the reserve.
ent-ActionXenomorphGenerateEggs = Generate eggs
    .desc = Produces an egg every 30 seconds. Drains 15 plasma every two seconds and pauses when storage is full.
ent-ActionXenomorphResinHole = Plant resin trap (200)
    .desc = Creates a hollow on the weeds below you. Place a facehugger inside to ambush passing hosts. A Burrower can charge an empty trap with acid for 100 plasma by interacting with it for three seconds.
ent-DumontXenomorphEggItem = xenomorph egg
    .desc = A leathery egg ready to take root. Use it on weeds to plant it for 30 plasma. An Eggsac can also sustain up to four eggs off weeds.
ent-DumontXenomorphResinHole = resin trap
    .desc = A small hollow in the resin.
xenomorph-carrier-storage = Facehuggers: {$parasites}/{$maxParasites}. Eggs: {$eggs}/{$maxEggs}.
xenomorph-carrier-full = Your storage is full.
xenomorph-carrier-reserve-title = Facehugger reserve
xenomorph-carrier-reserve-apply = Apply


ent-ActionXenomorphResinWalker = Resin walker (50)
    .desc = Move 66% faster on weeds. While active, consumes 15 plasma every half second.
ent-ActionXenomorphHivelordPlasma = Transfer plasma (200)
    .desc = Channel plasma to another xenomorph within seven meters. Transfers 200 every half second while you have plasma and the target has space.

xenomorph-plasma-transfer-invalid = Choose another xenomorph to transfer plasma.
xenomorph-plasma-transfer-range = The target must be visible and within seven meters.
xenomorph-plasma-transfer-empty = You need at least 200 plasma.
xenomorph-plasma-transfer-ovipositor = The queen must detach from her ovipositor to receive plasma.
xenomorph-plasma-transfer-full = The target already has full plasma.

ent-ActionXenomorphLunge = Lunge
    .desc = Lunge up to five meters and grab the first enemy hit. Paralyzes the victim for up to four seconds; releasing the grab ends the paralysis.
ent-ActionXenomorphEncasedPlates = Encased plates
    .desc = Close your plates for stronger frontal protection and knockdown immunity. Reduces speed by 32% and slashing damage by 8. Use again to open them.
ent-ActionXenomorphPlateBash = Plate bash
    .desc = Bash an enemy for 20 damage and 0.8 seconds of paralysis. With open plates, leap up to three meters; with closed plates, hit an adjacent enemy and knock them farther away.
ent-ActionXenomorphBulwarkTailSwing = Tail swing
    .desc = Sweep enemies within 1.75 meters for 20 slashing damage and 1.2 seconds of paralysis. Also knocks grenades away. Requires open plates.
ent-ActionXenomorphReflectiveShield = Reflective shield
    .desc = With closed plates, reflect projectiles for ten seconds: 80% chance from the front, 65% from the sides and 30% from behind. Use again to stop early.
xenomorph-bulwark-bash-range = With closed plates, the target must be adjacent.
xenomorph-bulwark-tail-encased = Open your plates before swinging your tail.
xenomorph-bulwark-shield-encase = Close your plates before activating the reflective shield.

ent-ActionXenomorphBurrow = Burrow
    .desc = Burrow underground in 1.5 seconds, then choose a nearby location to emerge. Without a destination, you emerge after nine seconds.
ent-ActionXenomorphTremor = Tremor (100)
    .desc = Strike the ground and stun enemies within four meters for two seconds.
ent-ActionXenomorphDigTunnel = Dig tunnel (200)
    .desc = Dig for four seconds to create a tunnel entrance. Each entrance holds three xenomorphs.
ent-DumontXenomorphTunnel = xenomorph tunnel
    .desc = An underground passage dug through the structure.
xenomorph-burrow-invalid = You need unobstructed flooring to burrow.
xenomorph-burrow-destination = Choose nearby unobstructed flooring on the same structure.
xenomorph-tunnel-default-name = Tunnel ({ $x }, { $y })
xenomorph-tunnel-unavailable = You cannot enter this tunnel now. Check its capacity and entrance.
xenomorph-tunnel-title = Tunnel network
xenomorph-tunnel-rename = Rename
xenomorph-tunnel-travel = Travel
xenomorph-tunnel-exit = Leave tunnel

ent-ActionXenomorphFleshHarvest = Flesh harvest (50 plasma)
    .desc = Dismember an unrevivable humanoid corpse for 150 flesh resin. Takes four seconds and each corpse can only be harvested once.
ent-ActionXenomorphRapture = Rapture
    .desc = Tear flesh from an enemy within three meters. Deals 20 blunt and 15 cellular damage and generates 60 flesh resin.
ent-ActionXenomorphFleshBloom = Flesh bloom (100 flesh)
    .desc = After two seconds, cover a 3 by 3 area in flesh blooms for eight seconds. Poisons and slows enemies while healing blunt and slash damage on xenos.
ent-ActionXenomorphRedGas = Red gas (20 flesh per tile)
    .desc = Release a widening toxic cloud up to seven meters away. Each tile costs 20 flesh resin and lasts six seconds.
ent-ActionXenomorphCarrionMantle = Carrion mantle (100 flesh)
    .desc = Protect yourself or another xeno within five meters. Grants a 200 shield, 15 armor and knockdown immunity for eight seconds, reducing speed by 10%. The remaining shield then decays by 70 per second.
xenomorph-reaper-flesh-name = Flesh resin
xenomorph-reaper-flesh-desc = Resource for Reaper abilities. Generates 2 per second up to 300, gains 5 for striking enemies and stores up to 1000. Click to check your supply.
xenomorph-reaper-flesh = Flesh resin: { $amount } / { $max }.
xenomorph-reaper-no-flesh = You need { $amount } flesh resin.
xenomorph-reaper-harvest-invalid = Choose an unharvested humanoid corpse that is fully rotten or unrevivable.

ent-ActionXenomorphAssault = Assault (25)
    .desc = Charge up to five meters, destroying tables and racks in your path. Melee hits reduce the cooldown by three seconds. While super-empowered, damage, knock down and fling the first enemy hit.
ent-ActionXenomorphEmpower = Empower (50)
    .desc = Gain 50 shield. Use again or wait six seconds to gain 50 per nearby enemy, up to six targets. With at least three targets, empower your attacks, assault and scissor cut for 6.5 seconds.
ent-ActionXenomorphScissorCut = Scissor cut (25)
    .desc = Cut enemies, fences and windows along a four-meter line. While super-empowered, also slow enemies hit.

xenomorph-ravager-super-empower = Super-empowered! Assault knocks down and flings; Scissor Cut slows.
xenomorph-ravager-empower-targets = { $targets }/3 nearby enemies. Assault cannot knock down without super-empowerment.

ent-ActionXenomorphFireSpikes = Fire spikes (75)
    .desc = Fire eight bone chips in a four-meter cone. The spikes slow their victims.
ent-ActionXenomorphSpikeShield = Spike shield (150)
    .desc = Gain 500 shield for two seconds. Each incoming projectile sprays seven spikes around you, reaching two meters.
ent-ActionXenomorphSpikeShed = Shed spikes (all)
    .desc = With at least 50 spikes, consume all of them to spray 40 around your body. Lose your spike armor and gain 45% speed for 30 seconds, preventing spike regeneration during that time.
xenomorph-hedgehog-no-shards = You need at least { $amount } spikes.
xenomorph-hedgehog-shards-name = Spikes
xenomorph-hedgehog-shards-desc = Spikes accumulated for abilities. Every 50 spikes grant additional armor.
xenomorph-hedgehog-shards = Spikes: { $amount } / { $max }.
xenomorph-hedgehog-shed = You shed your spikes! They will start regrowing in 30 seconds.
xenomorph-hedgehog-regrowth = Your spikes start regrowing.

ent-DumontXenomorphSpike = bone chips
ent-DumontXenomorphSpikeShort = bone chips

xenomorph-rage-locked = Your rage has reached its peak!
xenomorph-rage-expired = Your rage subsides. You need 10 seconds before building it again.
xenomorph-rage-examine = Rage: {$amount}/5.

ent-ActionXenomorphApprehend = Apprehend
    .desc = Increases your speed for 5 seconds. Your next slash slows its victim for 5 seconds.
ent-ActionXenomorphClothesline = Clothesline
    .desc = Flings the target and heals 95 health. With at least 2 rage stacks, throws farther and heals 220.
ent-ActionXenomorphEviscerate = Eviscerate
    .desc = Spends one rage stack to strike nearby enemies after a windup. Damage and range scale with rage. Heals 50 health per victim, up to 250.
xenomorph-apprehend-active = You speed up, preparing to apprehend your next victim!
xenomorph-apprehend-hit = Your slash slows the victim!
xenomorph-eviscerate-no-rage = You need at least one rage stack.
xenomorph-eviscerate-windup = You prepare to eviscerate nearby enemies!

ent-ActionXenomorphSacrifice = Sacrifice
    .desc = Sacrifice your life to heal a nearby sister and clear incapacitating effects. You only return as a larva with a full transferred-healing reserve.
xenomorph-healer-reserve-name = Transferred healing
xenomorph-healer-reserve-desc = Salving other castes builds transferred healing. Fill the reserve to return after sacrificing yourself.
xenomorph-healer-reserve = Transferred healing: {$amount}/{$max}.
xenomorph-healer-rebirth-ready = Your transferred healing is full! You can return as a larva after sacrificing yourself.
xenomorph-healer-sacrifice = A sister sacrificed herself to restore your vitality!
xenomorph-healer-reborn = You return as a larva after your sacrifice.

ent-ActionXenomorphPlantLesserFruit = Plant resin fruit (50)
    .desc = Plant a healing fruit on weeds for 50 plasma and 50 health. It matures in 15 seconds. You can keep up to three fruits.
ent-ActionXenomorphHealerTransferPlasma = Transfer plasma (100)
    .desc = Transfer 100 plasma to a nearby xenomorph every 1.5 seconds while remaining still.
ent-DumontXenomorphFruitLesser = lesser resin fruit
    .desc = A strange greenish fruit growing from alien resin.
xenomorph-fruit-plant-blocked = Plant on floor weeds, away from structures and nodes.
xenomorph-fruit-overflow = Your oldest fruit withers to make room for the new one.
xenomorph-fruit-harvest = Harvest fruit
xenomorph-fruit-consume = Eat fruit
xenomorph-fruit-healed = You absorb the fruit's effects.
xenomorph-fruit-growing = The fruit is still growing.
xenomorph-fruit-ripe = The fruit is ready to eat.
xenomorph-fruit-heal-examine = Restores 50 health. Harvesting or eating takes two seconds; you can also feed it to another xeno.
xenomorph-healer-plasma-invalid = Choose a nearby xenomorph that needs plasma. You need at least 100 plasma and cannot transfer to a queen with an ovipositor.
xenomorph-healer-plasma-received = You received plasma.

ent-ActionXenomorphPlantFruit = Plant resin fruit (100)
    .desc = Plant the chosen fruit on weeds for 100 plasma and 50 health. Keep up to six fruits, including harvested ones.
ent-ActionXenomorphChooseFruit = Choose resin fruit
    .desc = Choose the next fruit to grow. Your plants change color to match your choice.
