xenomorph-fruit-effect-speed = Increases movement speed by 0.2 m/s for 15 seconds. Does not stack.
xenomorph-fruit-effect-spore = For 90 seconds, each melee hit against an enemy reduces future cooldowns by 5%, up to 25%.
xenomorph-fruit-effect-unstable = Regenerates 75 health over 15 seconds and grants a shield of up to 30% maximum health, capped at 200. After one minute it decays by 10 per second.
xenomorph-fruit-buff-end = The fruit's effect has ended.

ent-ActionXenomorphPlantHardyWeeds = Plant hardy weeds (125)
    .desc = Plant a hardy resin node. Fruit grows 25% faster on its weeds. Two-minute cooldown.
ent-ActionXenomorphResinSurge = Resin surge (75)
    .desc = Ripen fruit, reinforce a resin structure for 15 seconds or raise a temporary wall on weeds. On clear ground, creates a 3x3 patch of sticky resin after one second.
ent-DumontXenomorphHardyWeed = hardy resin floor
ent-DumontXenomorphHardyWeedNode = hardy resin node
ent-DumontXenomorphSurgeWall = weak resin wall
    .desc = A thin wall of resin already on the verge of collapsing.
ent-DumontXenomorphWeakStickyResin = weak sticky resin
    .desc = A thin layer of sticky resin that is already melting.
xenomorph-surge-fruit = The surge accelerates the fruit's growth.

ent-ActionXenomorphPlantWeeds = Plant weeds (50)
    .desc = Plant a node that spreads resin across the floor.
ent-ActionXenomorphBuildResinWall = Build resin wall (50)
    .desc = Secrete resin to form a wall.
ent-ActionXenomorphBuildResinDoor = Build resin door (75)
    .desc = Secrete resin to form a door.
ent-ActionXenomorphCorrosiveAcid = Corrosive acid (100)
    .desc = Cover a structure in acid to corrode it over time.
ent-ActionXenomorphCombatMode = Combat mode
    .desc = Switch between helping and attacking.
