    .desc = Look farther ahead after standing still for half a second. Movement is 20% slower while active.
ent-ActionXenomorphSprayAcidBoiler = Spray strong acid (40)
    .desc = Spray strong acid in a line, dealing corrosive damage and knocking victims down for two seconds. Also corrodes barricades and extinguishes fire.
ent-DumontXenomorphStrongAcidSpray = strong acid splatter
    .desc = A layer of corrosive acid.

ent-ActionXenomorphBombard = Bombard (200)
    .desc = Prepare for 4.5 seconds, then launch a glob of acid or neurotoxin gas. Shares a cooldown with the defensive shroud.
ent-ActionXenomorphToggleGas = Toggle gas type
    .desc = Switch between corrosive acid and neurotoxin. Neurotoxin causes disorientation, slowing and suffocation as exposure builds.
ent-ActionXenomorphAcidShroud = Defensive shroud
    .desc = After 0.75 seconds, create a small cloud of the selected gas around yourself. Puts bombard, spray and this ability on cooldown for 30 seconds.
