ent-ActionXenomorphPraetorianSpit = Acid spit (25)
    .desc = Deal corrosive damage and build acid stacks. Each hit grants 15 shield, up to 45.
ent-ActionXenomorphPraetorianDash = Dash (40)
    .desc = Dash up to six meters without knocking targets down.
ent-ActionXenomorphAcidBall = Acid ball (80)
    .desc = Prepare for one second and launch a ball that splits into 14 projectiles after stopping. Each victim can be hit by up to four fragments.
ent-ActionXenomorphSprayAcidPraetorian = Spray acid (80)
    .desc = Spray acid over seven meters, building acid stacks. Five stacks burst for additional corrosive damage.
ent-DumontXenomorphAcidBall = acid ball
    .desc = A small, pulsating ball of gas.

ent-ActionXenomorphDodge = Dodge (200)
    .desc = For 15 seconds, move through other characters and gain 35% movement speed, increasing to 60% near standing enemies.
dumont-xenomorph-dodge-start = You prepare to dodge!
dumont-xenomorph-dodge-end = Your dodge has ended.

ent-ActionXenomorphTailLance = Tail lance
    .desc = Thrust your tail into an enemy. Misses have a shorter cooldown.
ent-ActionXenomorphImpale = Impale (80)
    .desc = Impale a nearby enemy, piercing armor. Hits twice on a red-marked target, consuming the mark.
ent-ActionXenomorphTailTrip = Tail trip (30)
    .desc = Trip a nearby enemy. A red mark extends the knockdown and daze, consuming the mark.
dumont-xenomorph-dancer-projectile-dodge = You dodge a projectile!
dumont-xenomorph-dancer-yellow-target = You have been marked by the Dancer!

ent-ActionXenomorphPierce = Pierce (50)
    .desc = Pierce up to four enemies in a three-meter line. Hitting two enemies restores your shield.
ent-ActionXenomorphBlitz = Blitz (50)
    .desc = Dash up to six meters, then slash around you after three seconds. Use again to slash early. Hitting an enemy restores your shield.
ent-ActionXenomorphCleaveRoot = Cleave root
    .desc = Root a nearby enemy for one second, or 1.8 seconds while shielded. Shares its cooldown with Cleave fling.
ent-ActionXenomorphCleaveFling = Cleave fling
    .desc = Fling a nearby enemy three meters, or six meters while shielded. Shares its cooldown with Cleave root.
dumont-xenomorph-vanguard-shield-regen = Your shield has recovered!
dumont-xenomorph-vanguard-shield-hit = Your shield is weakening!
dumont-xenomorph-vanguard-shield-break = Your shield has broken!

ent-ActionXenomorphTailSeize = Tail seize
    .desc = Launch your tail up to 3.5 meters, dealing 40 Slash and pulling the first enemy hit. Roots and slows them on arrival. Consumes your melee attack and costs no plasma.
ent-ActionXenomorphAbduct = Abduct (180)
    .desc = After 0.8 seconds, pull enemies in a six-meter line. One victim is slowed; two are rooted and dazed; three or more are knocked down for longer.
ent-ActionXenomorphDislocate = Dislocate (55)
    .desc = Strike and push a nearby enemy. Debilitated enemies are rooted and the hit ignores armor. Reduces Abduct and Tail Lash cooldowns by five seconds.
ent-ActionXenomorphTailLash = Tail lash (80)
    .desc = After 0.2 seconds, fling, knock down and slow enemies in a 2×3-meter area in front of you.

dumont-xenomorph-oppressor-no-room = There is no clear space to use this ability.
dumont-xenomorph-abduct-cancel = You interrupted the abduction.
