ent-ActionXenomorphTailFountain = Tail fountain
    .desc = Extinguish a nearby ally or foe. Consumes your melee attack and costs no plasma.
ent-ActionXenomorphTantrum = Tantrum (100 plasma, 75 fury)
    .desc = Gain 10 armor for five seconds and grant an ally 15 armor for three seconds. Ravagers and Crushers receive 33% speed for two seconds instead.
ent-ActionXenomorphHighGallop = High gallop
    .desc = Knock down and slow enemies in a 2×3-meter area in front of you. Also repels grenades.
ent-ActionXenomorphFightOrFlight = Fight or flight (300 plasma, 75 fury)
    .desc = Clear incapacitations and slows from nearby xenos. The radius increases from four to six meters if at least 75 fury remains after paying the cost.
ent-ActionXenomorphRetrieve = Retrieve (180 plasma, 100 fury)
    .desc = Prepare for 0.6 seconds, then pull a nearby allied xeno to you. The queen must be resting or incapacitated.
dumont-xenomorph-fury-name = Fury
dumont-xenomorph-fury-desc = Stored fury used to support and retrieve allies.
dumont-xenomorph-fury-amount = Fury: { $amount } / 200.
dumont-xenomorph-valkyrie-resources = This ability requires { $plasma } plasma and { $fury } fury.

ent-ActionXenomorphPrimeAcid = For the hive!
    .desc = Prime an acid explosion in 20 seconds. Requires at least 200 acid. Your reserves determine damage and range. You are slowed; use again to cancel at the cost of a quarter of your acid. Death prevents detonation. Detonating respawns you as a larva at the explosion site.
ent-ActionXenomorphHide = Hide
    .desc = Hide underneath objects and structures. Does not grant invisibility.
ent-ActionXenomorphAciderCorrode = Strong corrosive acid (100 acid)
    .desc = Coat an item or barricade with strong acid. Cannot melt walls.
dumont-xenomorph-acid-reserve-name = Acid reserves
dumont-xenomorph-acid-reserve-desc = Stored acid for your abilities. Passive generation stops at 400; attacks allow up to 1000.
dumont-xenomorph-acid-reserve-amount = Acid: {$amount} / 1000.
dumont-xenomorph-acider-container = You cannot prime an explosion inside a container or vent.
dumont-xenomorph-acider-not-enough = You need at least 200 acid.
dumont-xenomorph-acider-prime = For the hive! Detonation in 20 seconds!
dumont-xenomorph-acider-cancel = Detonation cancelled. You lost a quarter of your acid reserves.

ent-ActionXenomorphToxicSpit = Toxic spit (30)
    .desc = Launch a toxic projectile that passes over allies, deals damage and adds five intoxication stacks. Seven-meter projectile range.
ent-ActionXenomorphToxicSlash = Toxic slash (100)
    .desc = Coat your next three melee hits for up to four seconds. Each hit adds five intoxication stacks. Gain 20% movement speed for four seconds.
ent-ActionXenomorphDrainSting = Drain sting (75)
    .desc = Consume 70% of a nearby victim's intoxication to deal damage, knock them down, and recover health and plasma. At 20 stacks or more, gain 15 armor for 12 seconds.
ent-ActionXenomorphWeakCorrode = Weak corrosive acid (75)
    .desc = Coat an object or structure with acid after four seconds. Acid damages it for up to 125 seconds.
dumont-xenomorph-intoxicated-name = Intoxicated
dumont-xenomorph-intoxicated-desc = Toxins damage you every two seconds and slow you at 20 stacks or more. Click to roll for three seconds and remove eight stacks. Moving interrupts resistance.
dumont-xenomorph-intoxicated-gained = You feel toxins spreading through your body!

ent-ActionXenomorphVenatorSpit = Corrosive spit (45)
    .desc = Fire concentrated acid that deals damage, coats the victim and leaves a small corrosive pool.
ent-ActionXenomorphVenatorBlob = Acid blob (65)
    .desc = Lob a glob that spreads five pools in a cross or diagonal pattern. Directly hitting an already acid-coated victim strengthens the corrosion and paralyzes them for two seconds.
ent-ActionXenomorphVenatorBreath = Enzymatic breath (55)
    .desc = Fire five projectiles in a narrow arc. Impacts leave corrosive pools.
ent-ActionXenomorphStoreAcid = Store acid (150)
    .desc = Store up to five charges. Each charge reduces armor by five and increases incoming damage by 5%. An attack consumes one charge to shorten the shared cooldown from 11 seconds to one. Storage is locked for four seconds after firing.
dumont-xenomorph-venator-store-locked = Wait before storing more acid.
dumont-xenomorph-venator-stored = Acid charges: { $amount } / 5.

ent-ActionXenomorphVampireRush = Rush
    .desc = Rush up to four meters and slash the first enemy hit for 40 damage, shaking their vision.
ent-ActionXenomorphFlurry = Flurry
    .desc = Slash a narrow area in front of you for 35 damage per target. Heal 30 health per victim after one second, up to four targets. Does not generate healing while you are on fire.
ent-ActionXenomorphTailJab = Tail jab
    .desc = Jab a target up to 2.5 meters away for 50 damage, slowing them for half a second and pushing them back. Hitting a wall deals additional damage and paralyzes them for half a second.
ent-ActionXenomorphHeadbite = Headbite
    .desc = Execute a critical or unconscious victim after 0.8 seconds and heal 150 health. Moving interrupts the execution. Cannot target hosts infected by the hive; does not generate healing while you are on fire.
dumont-xenomorph-headbite-infected = Do not destroy a host infected by the hive.
dumont-xenomorph-headbite-invalid = Choose a nearby critical or unconscious victim.
dumont-xenomorph-headbite-start = You prepare to bite through the victim's skull!

ent-ActionXenomorphRemoteResinWall = Coerce resin wall (50)
    .desc = Build a wall in 1 second. While on weeds, build within sight up to 11 tiles away; remote construction takes 2.5 seconds.
ent-ActionXenomorphRemoteResinDoor = Coerce resin door (75)
    .desc = Build a door in 1 second. While on weeds, build within sight up to 11 tiles away; remote construction takes 2.5 seconds.
dumont-xenomorph-remote-resin-unreachable = Stand on weeds and keep the location visible within 11 tiles to build remotely.
dumont-xenomorph-remote-resin-door = Control resin door

ent-ActionXenomorphDesignOptimized = Optimized design (50)
    .desc = Place a design on weeds within 15 tiles. Resin construction on it takes half the time.
ent-ActionXenomorphDesignFlexible = Flexible design (60)
    .desc = Place a design on weeds within 15 tiles. Resin construction on it costs half the plasma.
ent-ActionXenomorphDesignConstruct = Construct design (70)
    .desc = Place a design on weeds within 15 tiles. A xeno can activate it with 70 plasma to form a structure in 4 seconds.
ent-ActionXenomorphDesignToggle = Selected design
    .desc = Toggle wall and door markers. Construction bonuses apply to both structures.
ent-ActionXenomorphDesignRemove = Remove design (25)
    .desc = Remove one of your designs within 15 tiles.
ent-ActionXenomorphDesignThicken = Remote thickening (60)
    .desc = Thicken a resin wall or door within 10 tiles in 1 second. Weedbound structures cannot be thickened remotely.
ent-ActionXenomorphDesignSurge = Greater resin surge (250)
    .desc = Consume your designs within 7 tiles. After 1 second, they form reflective walls lasting 13 seconds.
dumont-xenomorph-design-door = Your designs now mark doors.
dumont-xenomorph-design-wall = Your designs now mark walls.
dumont-xenomorph-design-surge-none = There are no designs of yours nearby to convert.

ent-ActionXenomorphChooseResin = Choose resin structure
    .desc = Select the resin structure to secrete.
ent-ActionXenomorphSecreteResin = Secrete resin
    .desc = Build the selected structure on weeds. Plasma is consumed on completion.

ent-ActionXenomorphQueenScreech = Queen screech (250)
    .desc = Debilitate nearby enemies for 8 seconds. Costs 250 plasma.
ent-ActionXenomorphQueenSpit = Acid volley (40)
    .desc = Fire three acid projectiles. Each target can only be hit once per volley.
ent-ActionXenomorphQueenGut = Gut (200)
    .desc = Tear apart a nearby victim after 8 seconds. Moving interrupts the action.
ent-ActionXenomorphQueenHeal = Heal the hive (600)
    .desc = Heal sisters in a 4 tile radius for 30% of their health over 20 seconds. Requires an ovipositor.
ent-ActionXenomorphQueenPlasma = Give plasma (400)
    .desc = Restore 75% of a sister’s maximum plasma in the watched area. Requires an ovipositor.
